# The scripts need a model to talk to. There are two ways to give them one.
#
# OPTION 1: OpenAI
#   Copy this file to ".env" (same folder) and paste your key after the "=".
#   Get a key at https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
OPENAI_API_KEY=

# OPTION 2: Ollama (free, runs on your own computer)
#   Leave OPENAI_API_KEY empty, or have no ".env" at all, and the scripts use
#   Ollama automatically. Ollama has to be running (open the app, or run
#   "ollama serve").
#
#   The two lines below are optional. Remove the "#" to change a default.
#   Use a model name exactly as "ollama list" prints it.
# OLLAMA_MODEL=qwen3.5:2b
# OLLAMA_BASE_URL=http://localhost:11434/v1
